{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">八號信號生效期間，各區雨勢稍為加大。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在杏花邨海邊，不時有湧浪拍岸。有工作人員在風雨轉大前，檢查擋水板等設施。有民安隊人員到岸邊視察。雨勢凌晨零時過後開始增強。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026oup2z8xvvE1785000810.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026M0CcWRpCI81785000821.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而在市區，旺角凌晨起亦驟雨變得頻密，出外的市民都要撐傘。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026uMNxWcCQHu1785000850.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0100_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T17:59:07.808519+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}